{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2024-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1729036800, "end_date": 1729727999, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:00:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "177581612", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157396854", "personaname": "飞行员隔壁老戴", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ima2b/", "num_games_owned": 442, "num_reviews": 356, "playtime_forever": 503, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 503, "last_played": 1729685814, "avatar": "76452b65a3f7614908489832615035221f896cc2"}, "language": "english", "review": "DNF/10\n", "timestamp_created": 1729687137, "timestamp_updated": 1729687137, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.414122194051742554", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177581610", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064591615", "personaname": "❤Ilona", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imAgoodSensation/", "num_games_owned": 609, "num_reviews": 85, "playtime_forever": 3964, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3834, "last_played": 1754159770, "avatar": "67f7ea53617b80432847cc96912f5ce4feb9e54e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game always feels like a miracle to me.\n\nThe game excels in universe exploration, offering lush alien landscapes and ancient mysteries at every turn. \n\nExistential themes pulse through the narrative, questioning what it means to start anew, and the price of survival, as well as the thrill of finding humanity a new home in the Andromeda galaxy. \n\n[h3]The game’s atmosphere totally engulfs me. It's like you're immersed in a cinematic experience.[/h3]\n\nThe game just feels REAL. As if it was made by a thousand people (maybe it was). It has such an engaging writing, makes me think professionals from different fields of knowledge has held hands and to take their job seriously and build this piece. \n\nAnd most importantly, it throws in some unexpected laughs to spice up the sci-fi drama.\n\n[h1]10/10\nEngaging cosmic tale and gameplay, with wit and intrigue. 🚀✨[/h1]", "timestamp_created": 1729687134, "timestamp_updated": 1729761938, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 77, "votes_funny": 10, "weighted_vote_score": "0.645465254783630371", "comment_count": 8, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 10, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "177558775", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017725249", "personaname": "khorneschampion", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017725249/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3802, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 872, "last_played": 1763938500, "avatar": "a49c56257b48e3b5722bcc3f8c68538c1599bba0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Interesting addition to the series, combat is fluid and dynamic but some things like messages and equipment screens can be annoying to navigate quickly.", "timestamp_created": 1729645543, "timestamp_updated": 1729645543, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482162654399871826", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177508762", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985829004", "personaname": "Waltz∆", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NaturalSelection/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 7393, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3080, "playtime_at_review": 2800, "last_played": 1791292389, "avatar": "cc44adb355bc00f00326df76e988bf4a5581ca82"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decent game to pass the time even if the game is not to the level of the original trilogy. Mods improve on the experience vastly so get to modding if you want to give this a go.", "timestamp_created": 1729582935, "timestamp_updated": 1729582935, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495185971260070801", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177487019", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070901495", "personaname": "SanctusUn1s", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070901495/", "num_games_owned": 423, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 7248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7248, "deck_playtime_at_review": 56, "last_played": 1729532562, "avatar": "e80fe7a4a794c1c1e7af10706d9b664933f2de42"}, "language": "english", "review": "When this game came out, I became disinterested because I thought it lacked what the original Mass effect series had, however, I found the game the quite enjoyable when coming back to it a few years later. It had the friendships you make along with your team, gameplay is more smoother, and the story a bit a happier ending. I know we probably wanted a continuation of whatever happened to Commander shepard back in the trilogy it was a nice refresher of a different story even though we are still in the same universe.", "timestamp_created": 1729543463, "timestamp_updated": 1729543463, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482162654399871826", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}